msgstr "关闭时,游客看不到窗户;管理员可以通过“现场试用”进行预览。"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

msgid "AI + live chat"
msgstr "人工智能+实时聊天"

msgid "The assistant answers and hands over to an agent when needed. Recommended."
msgstr "助理会在需要时接听并移交给座席。受到推崇的。"

msgid "AI only"
msgstr "仅人工智能"

msgid "No handoff; the assistant shares your contact details."
msgstr "无需切换;助理会分享您的联系方式。"

msgid "Live chat only"
msgstr "仅实时聊天"

