msgstr "Flux Chat(如果可用),否则插件收件箱。"

msgid "Call center inbox, together with WhatsApp chats."
msgstr "呼叫中心收件箱,以及 WhatsApp 聊天。"

msgid "Flux Chat 1.37+ is not installed; the inbox is used."
msgstr "Flux Chat 1.37+ 未安装;使用收件箱。"

msgid "Chatbot › Chats screen, with email notification."
msgstr "聊天机器人 › 聊天屏幕,带有电子邮件通知。"

msgid "Ask for email"
msgstr "索取电子邮件"

msgid "Only outside working hours"
msgstr "仅限工作时间以外"

msgid "Before handing over"
msgstr "移交前"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "从来没有"

msgid "Notification email"
msgstr "通知邮件"

msgid "New handoffs and after-hours messages. When empty, the site admin."
msgstr "新的交接和下班后消息。当为空时,站点管理员。"

msgid "After-hours message"
msgstr "下班后消息"

msgid "Also send replies by email"
msgstr "也可以通过电子邮件发送回复"

msgid "If the visitor has left the page, the agent's reply goes to their email."
msgstr "如果访问者离开了页面,代理的回复将发送到他们的电子邮件中。"

msgid "End-of-chat rating"
msgstr "聊天结束评分"

msgid "1-5 stars and an optional note."
msgstr "1-5 星和可选注释。"

msgid "File sharing"
msgstr "文件共享"

